<title>UK: Canal Plus sets 2.0 bln Ffr convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus sets 2.0 bln Ffr convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CANAL PLUS</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON   **3.25-3.75 MATURITY    28.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    IND PREM    13 -16 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	**INDICATED. FOUR-YEAR NON-CALL</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	CONVERTIBLE INTO SHARES OF MEDIASET SPA.</p>
<p> 18-MONTH MANDATORY CALL IF CANAL'S MERGER WITH NETHOLD IS NOT  COMPLETED BY 31.AUG.97</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
